From 47a07d4f1ea5c6961e9807682c54fec4df287b01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian <219239532+markd3ng@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 09:06:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(mime): sniff extensionless binaries and default empty
 filenames to Untitled

Store a sniffed mimeType for extensionless PNG/JPEG/GIF/WEBP/PDF/ZIP uploads and serve it after ?mime=/ext/filename, while keeping DISALLOWED_MIME sanitization. Empty upload names become Untitled so official clients no longer send a blank Content-Disposition filename.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
